# Project essay markdown

Essay sources feed `manage.py seed_blog` (allow-listed `*.md` → Django HTML). Do not invent a `content/blog` tree.

After creating or editing essay markdown:

```bash
cd ~/.cursor/blog-lint && python3 -m blog_lint --check --roots gl-project-essays
```

Apply fixes only when asked:

```bash
python3 -m blog_lint --write --roots gl-project-essays
```

To refresh API posts (homelab / compose with `/essays` mount), use:

```bash
./scripts/refresh-essays.sh --lint-only
./scripts/refresh-essays.sh --seed-dry-run
./scripts/refresh-essays.sh --seed
```

Never pass `--publish` unless the user explicitly wants published posts. Follow `technical-writing-standards` and skill `technical-seo-and-content-optimisation` for meta on the Next routes, not auto front matter injection.
